    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150901",
      "en": "Greetings, and welcome to the Presidium. My name is Avina, and I am pleased to be your virtual guide throughout this level of the Citadel space station.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150902",
      "en": "Our records indicate this is your first time on the Citadel. A brief orientation session is customary. Please allow me to do my job.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150903",
      "en": "I am a fully interactive virtual intelligence, programmed to provide spontaneous guidance at predetermined locations of interest throughout this level of the Citadel.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150904",
      "en": "I may also be contacted through any of the Presidium VI terminals, should you require assistance.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150905",
      "en": "I apologize if you found my service unsatisfactory. Please submit any complaints in writing to the Citadel Tourist and Visitor Board. Have a nice day.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150906",
      "en": "Welcome to Presidium Tourism Terminal III. Here in the financial district, a number of businesses offer various goods and services to their exclusive clientele.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150907",
      "en": "The statue you see before you was commissioned to honor the krogan soldiers who gave their lives to protect Citadel Space during the Rachni Wars. ",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150908",
      "en": "In the aftermath of the Krogan Rebellions, several embassies petitioned to have the statue removed. However, this motion was eventually quashed by the Council.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150909",
      "en": "Nearly 2200 years ago, explorers seeking to expand Citadel Space opened up mass relays leading to systems controlled by the rachni.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150910",
      "en": "A highly intelligent and aggressive insect race, the rachni unleashed a war of conquest against the rest of the galaxy that lasted for nearly three centuries.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150911",
      "en": "The emergence of the krogan finally turned the tide in favor of the Citadel species. Krogan forces provided the numbers necessary to halt the rachni advance and drive them back.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150912",
      "en": "The krogan then pursued their retreating fleets. Able to survive the harsh environments of the rachni homeworlds, the krogan hunted their enemy to extinction.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150913",
      "en": "I am sorry, but a value judgment of that nature goes beyond my programming.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150914",
      "en": "In recognition of their efforts during the Rachni Wars, the krogan were granted several new colony worlds by the Council.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150915",
      "en": "Over the next 400 years, the krogan species began to expand. Blessed with an extremely high birth rate, their numbers began to swell.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150916",
      "en": "Faced with a critical over-population crisis, the krogan started a violent colonization of nearby worlds inhabited by other Council species. The Krogan Rebellions had begun.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150917",
      "en": "For a full century, the Council and its member species fought to bring the krogan under control. With the aid of the newly discovered turian empire they were ultimately successful.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150918",
      "en": "I am sorry, but that question is beyond my programming parameters. The turians are members of the Citadel Council. They are not a threat to galactic peace.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150919",
      "en": "The krogan were instrumental in saving the galaxy from the rachni threat. The Council believed this historical fact should not be forgotten.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150920",
      "en": "The Council also hoped that preserving the memorial would improve diplomatic relations with the krogan and bring about a peaceful resolution to the Rebellions.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150921",
      "en": "Unfortunately, the krogan refused to negotiate, and only surrendered after their population and homeworlds had been ravaged by the turians.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150922",
      "en": "Thank you for using Avina. Have a pleasant day.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150923",
      "en": "This site was once the location of a memorial statue commemorating the krogan soldiers who gave their lives to protect Citadel Space during the Rachni Wars.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150924",
      "en": "In the wake of the Krogan Rebellions, several embassies petitioned to have the memorial removed. Initially the Council resisted, and the petition was denied.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150925",
      "en": "But hatred of the krogan was strong, and as the Krogan Rebellions intensified, the Council finally relented. The memorial was removed despite their reservations.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150926",
      "en": "So are you a person or a program?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150927",
      "en": "What does that mean?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150928",
      "en": "I don't need a guide.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150931",
      "en": "Give me the tour.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150932",
      "en": "I'll pass.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150935",
      "en": "What were the Rachni Wars?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150939",
      "en": "Was it really necessary to wipe them out?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150940",
      "en": "Tell me more about the Krogan Rebellions.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150944",
      "en": "You needed the krogan to stop the rachni. Then you needed the turians to stop the krogan. So who's going to stop the turians?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150945",
      "en": "Why did the Council fight so hard to keep the statue?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150948",
      "en": "Sounds like they got what they deserved.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150949",
      "en": "That's all for now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150952",
      "en": "Are you real?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150953",
      "en": "Virtual guide?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150954",
      "en": "No, thanks.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150957",
      "en": "Sounds interesting.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150958",
      "en": "Not interested.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150961",
      "en": "Rachni Wars",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150962",
      "en": "Krogan Rebellions",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150963",
      "en": "Memorial Statue",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150964",
      "en": "Log off.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150968",
      "en": "That's a little extreme.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150972",
      "en": "Sounds like a vicious cycle.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|150975",
      "en": "Serves them right.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_avina_stores_D|157622",
      "en": "Are you real?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159411",
      "en": "If you're going to make a krogan statue you might as well make it big, right?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159413",
      "en": "Hard to believe the krogan were once seen as the saviors of the galaxy.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159415",
      "en": "Some want to see this krogan monument removed. But it is important to remember our history... even if those memories make us uncomfortable.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159417",
      "en": "At the time this statue was built, the entire galaxy respected the krogan. Now they're simply hated and feared.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159419",
      "en": "This statue represents what the krogan used to be: a proud and fierce nation. Now we're just brutes for hire to the highest bidder. We've forgotten our roots.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159421",
      "en": "The krogan rebelled against the Council, yet they have a statue on the Citadel. And we quarians still live as outcasts.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159550",
      "en": "You won't have to put up with us for much longer, turian. My people will die out soon enough, thanks to you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159551",
      "en": "Some would argue you brought this on yourself. It was the krogan who started the war.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159552",
      "en": "And the turians made sure to finish it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159553",
      "en": "You're not really like other krogan, are you, Wrex?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159554",
      "en": "I'll take that as a compliment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159555",
      "en": "You're not like most other krogan, are you, Wrex?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159556",
      "en": "You are very different from the other krogan I have met, Wrex.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_02statue_DSG_LOC|sta20_banter_01_D|159557",
      "en": "At least you still live. In another two hundred years, this statue might be the only evidence my people ever existed.",
      "tr": ""
    }
  ]
}